<!-- ================= HOW IT WORKS ================= -->
<section class="sec" id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-head rv">
      <div class="sh-top"><span class="sec-no">(01)</span><span>HOW IT WORKS</span><span class="sh-rule"></span></div>
      <h2>Three steps. <em class="grad">Your files stay put.</em></h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">No upload wizard or cloud account required for local folders. Give Foldergram a readable path, run a scan, and browse.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="steps">
      <article class="step rv">
        <div class="s-no">01</div>
        <div class="s-body">
          <h3>Point it at your folder tree</h3>
          <p>Local disk, NAS mount, USB drive, or Docker bind mount. Every indexed folder containing supported media, including nested ones, becomes an App Folder with its own profile and grid. Add multiple local sources or optionally connect Immich. No second copy of your local originals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="s-vig">
          <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;border:1px solid var(--line2);background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:13px 16px;font:500 13px var(--f-mono)">
            <svg style="width:16px;height:16px;color:var(--acc)" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5.5 5h4l2 2.5h7A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 21 10v7.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 18.5 20h-13A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 3 17.5v-10Z"/></svg>
            /mnt/nas/photos/<span class="icaret" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
          <p class="vig-note">folders with supported media become profiles after scanning</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="step rv" style="--d:.08s">
        <div class="s-no">02</div>
        <div class="s-body">
          <h3>Files become posts. Videos become reels.</h3>
          <p>Bring photos over with rsync, Syncthing or an SD card. Scan the library to index changes (development mode can watch for them). Put story media inside an App Folder’s reserved <code>stories/</code> directory; its subfolders become highlights.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="s-vig">
          <div class="vig-post">
            <div class="ap-phead"><span class="ring" style="width:32px;height:32px"><img src="demo-media/animal-0.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="ap-pn">Animal Planet</span></div>
            <div class="ap-photo" style="aspect-ratio:3/2"><img src="demo-media/animal-1.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="ap-actions">
              <span class="iconbtn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:17px;height:17px"><path d="M12 20.2 4.7 13a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 6.4-6.4l.9.9.9-.9a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 6.4 6.4Z"/></svg></span>
              <span class="iconbtn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" style="width:17px;height:17px"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3"/><circle cx="9.2" cy="9.4" r="1.6"/><path d="m5 17 4.6-4.6 3.2 3.2 2.6-2.6L20 17.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
              <span class="ap-agrow"><span class="iconbtn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:17px;height:17px"><path d="M6 3.5h12V21l-6-4.6L6 21Z"/></svg></span></span>
            </div>
            <p class="ap-cap"><b>Animal Planet</b> tiger cub resting in natural habitat</p>
            <p class="ap-date">Mar 16, 2026</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="step rv" style="--d:.16s">
        <div class="s-no">03</div>
        <div class="s-body">
          <h3>Feels familiar. Feels like yours.</h3>
          <p>Scroll a familiar feed of your own photos with Recent, Rediscover and Random. Switch to a dedicated Reels view, revisit Stories and Moments, and save the posts you love. It feels like a modern social app, without anyone else’s algorithm to keep up with.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="s-vig">
          <div class="vig-rings">
            <span class="ap-story"><span class="ring"><img src="demo-media/st-tigers-0.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="ap-sname">Recent Batches</span></span>
            <span class="ap-story"><span class="ring"><img src="demo-media/st-lions-0.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="ap-sname">Deep Cuts</span></span>
            <span class="ap-story"><span class="ring"><img src="demo-media/st-season-0.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="ap-sname">Lucky Dip</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="vig-reelchip">
            <span class="vbadge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5Z"/></svg>0:12</span>
            <span>indexed videos appear in the Reels player</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
